  "transforms": [
    "toybox: CFG_TOYBOX_LIBCRYPTO 0 (toybox's own md5/sha1/sha2: the same digests) and CFG_TOYBOX_LIBZ 0 (toybox's lib/deflate.c added: gunzip output is the same; gzip output bytes may differ from zlib's)",
    "toybox: built against musl (Emscripten 3.1.74) without __BIONIC__: ps shows no scheduling policy name (libprocessgroup is absent: \"unknown\"), confstr is musl's",
    "toolbox: tools.h reduced to getprop, setprop, start, stop, toolbox (getevent and modprobe are not built: no /system/bin/getevent or /system/bin/modprobe)",
    "libbase properties.cpp built with __BIONIC__ (its bionic property path; the host path keeps a private map)",
    "the C library's system calls go to the lab's kernel (scripts/wasm/system-programs/lab-kernel.c, lab-libc.c, lab-selinux.c, lab-sigtables.c), over the virtual device's state (src/process-kernel.js)",
    "Asyncify (binaryen) instruments the programs so a process can wait and fork; -sSTANDALONE_WASM, JavaScript-based setjmp/longjmp"
  ]
